  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Aid for Health Fund (HAHF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an Official Development Assistance (ODA) funded UKaid project from the Department of Health and Social Care (DHSC)&apos;s Humanitarian Aid for Health Fund which provides donations of medical supplies to ODA-eligible countries in partnership with the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) and supports DHSC-led humanitarian projects, such as the International Medical Partnership (IMP) Initiative which pairs hospitals in the UK and Ukraine to provide training opportunities for Ukrainian clinicians.</narrative>
  </description>
